            "review_title": "Review at Won Korea Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Stray Cat\nHạ Long Bay, Vietnam44 contributions\n0\nMy 'go-to' Korean restaurant. Yummy!\nJul 2020\nMy wife and I have been coming to this restaurant for about 3 years now. It's our 'go-to' Korean restaurant. It's quite cheap, the food is always good and it's reliable. We really like the decor and the staff. The menu is extensive and it's a good place to take friends.\n\nWe usually visit once ever couple of weeks and everything we have had on the menu has been good. They even do a few Thai dishes too which have been quite good (pad-ga-pow & somtam). Our favourites are spicy seafood noodles, black bean noodle (super cheap and yummy) and seaweed soup. But, all dishes we have had from their menu have been superb. It gets two thumbs up from us!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 7, 2020",
